---
title: Events
layout: "base.njk"
navActive: events
eventSection: upcoming
---

<section class="container mt-1">
  <h1>Events</h1>
  <p class="events-intro">Things happening at the Shed — everyone is welcome. Come along, meet other members, and see what we're up to.</p>

  {% include "./partials/event-tabs.njk" %}

  <h2>Upcoming Events</h2>

  {% if upcomingEvents.length %}
    <div class="md:grid-cols-3 mb-1">
      {% for event in upcomingEvents %}
        {% include "./partials/event-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <p>No upcoming events at the moment — check back soon.</p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
